# ---- Site ----
# Absolute base URL of the deployment. Resolves relative Open Graph / metadata
# image URLs into absolute ones. Defaults to http://localhost:3000 in dev.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://cookbook.denejko.pl

# ---- Prompt playground (Phase 4) ----
# Replay mode (the default) needs NONE of these: scripted demos and free-text
# both return pre-recorded replies at zero cost, and work offline.

# Set to "live" to call Claude for free-text prompts (scripted demos stay replay).
DEMO_MODE=replay

# Required only when DEMO_MODE=live. Never commit a real key.
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...

# Optional live-mode caps.
# DEMO_MODEL=claude-haiku-4-5-20251001
# DEMO_MAX_TOKENS=400
# DEMO_RATE_LIMIT=8

# In production, put a real cap on spend with a dedicated Anthropic Workspace
# (Console -> Settings -> Workspaces -> Limits) scoped to the key above, and
# swap the in-memory rate limiter in app/api/demo/route.ts for @upstash/ratelimit.

# ---- Library ----
# Comma-separated visibilities to emit in a public build, e.g. "public" or
# "public,org_shared". Unset shows everything (personal / local use).
# LIBRARY_VISIBILITY=
